WEBVTT

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:03.687
You're the one in control
of creating the most pleasure for you.

00:08:03.687 --> 00:08:05.731
You're the protagonist.

00:08:05.731 --> 00:08:09.109
As much as you love someone
or feel attracted to them,

00:08:09.109 --> 00:08:11.695
they are playing a supporting role.

00:08:11.695 --> 00:08:12.947
And you for them.

00:08:14.198 --> 00:08:19.453
Sex is an avenue to accessing feelings
of aliveness, empowerment,

00:08:19.495 --> 00:08:21.205
joy and confidence

00:08:21.247 --> 00:08:22.915
innate to all of us.

00:08:23.457 --> 00:08:28.087
That aliveness,
that is the impact of sexual wellness.

00:08:28.128 --> 00:08:30.589
And you will feel it
walking down the street,